OL,3,GNEWSA'Predatory paedophile' jailed for
OL,4,Aabusing young child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "predatory paedophile" has been
OL,7,Fjailed for life for abusing and
OL,8,Fgrooming a young child in Jersey.
OL,10,FAaron Gardner, 36, from Jersey, was
OL,11,Fsentenced to a minimum of 14 years at
OL,12,Fthe Royal Court.
OL,14,FGardner was found guilty by jurors at a
OL,15,Ftrial in June of two counts of sexual
OL,16,Fpenetration of a child under the age of
OL,17,F12 and one count of sexual touching of
OL,18,Fa child under the age of 12.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
