OL,3,GNEWSA'Predatory paedophile' jailed for
OL,4,Aabusing young child
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresiding judge commissioner Patricia
OL,7,FLees described Gardner as a "predatory
OL,8,Fpaedophile with no boundaries". Jersey
OL,9,FPolice detective Carla Garnier, who was
OL,10,Fthe officer in charge of the case, said
OL,11,Fthe courage shown by the young victim
OL,12,Fthroughout the investigation and court
OL,13,Fproceedings had been "remarkable".
